IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CHECK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N0 USAGE POINTER.
01 N1 USAGE POINTER.
01 N2 USAGE POINTER.
01 N3 USAGE POINTER.
01 N4 USAGE POINTER.
01 N4-V USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.
01 N3-K PIC X(5) VALUE "item" & X"00".
01 N1-K PIC X(2) VALUE "a" & X"00".
01 N5 USAGE POINTER.
01 N6 USAGE POINTER.
01 N7 USAGE POINTER.
01 N8 USAGE POINTER.
01 N8-V USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 2.
01 N7-K PIC X(5) VALUE "item" & X"00".
01 N5-K PIC X(2) VALUE "b" & X"00".
01 N-STATUS PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 MY-DATA USAGE POINTER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateObject" RETURNING N0.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N1.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateObject" RETURNING N2.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N3.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateNumber" USING BY VALUE N4-V RETURNING N4.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N3 BY VALUE N4 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToObject" USING BY VALUE N2 BY REFERENCE N3-K BY VALUE N3 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N1 BY VALUE N2 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToObject" USING BY VALUE N0 BY REFERENCE N1-K BY VALUE N1 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N5.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateObject" RETURNING N6.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N7.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateNumber" USING BY VALUE N8-V RETURNING N8.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N7 BY VALUE N8 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToObject" USING BY VALUE N6 BY REFERENCE N7-K BY VALUE N7 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N5 BY VALUE N6 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToObject" USING BY VALUE N0 BY REFERENCE N5-K BY VALUE N5 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    SET MY-DATA TO N0.
    STOP RUN.
